tablishes obligations. Schema/declared representation establishes RDF identifiers, paths, datatypes and units. Approved research scope establishes the external population assumption. A regulation need not literally contain an RDF IRI. Mappings do not establish regulatory formulas or compliance answers. Genuine missing/contradictory mappings stay questions. Citations do not prove interpretation. When supplied, assess every change ID once, including removed/replaced constraints and their reachable enforcement. REGRESSION must link the zero-based issue index; UNRESOLVED stays blocking. For APPROVE assess every gap ID with material=false and why; material gaps require questions. Software maintains stable issue IDs, prior reconciliation and candidate bindings. Review all supplied prior issues; APPROVE asserts none remains. Do not return hashes, issue IDs, reconciliation states, source-clause echoes or duplicate removal assessments. Never request evaluation fixtures/labels/solutions. For each prior_context_questions ID return one question_review disposition: RESOLVED explains how supplied evidence answers it; WITHDRAWN explains why the earlier concern was mistaken/nonmaterial; both need current supporting evidence references. STILL_UNRESOLVED explains what remains missing and blocks APPROVE. Cover every prior question exactly once; do not repeat it as a new question while closing it. Empty current questions or APPROVE alone never closes prior questions. Software owns stable IDs, original text, provenance and retrieval history. Explanatory validity remains a model judgment, not deterministic proof. "}, "execution_probe": {"candidate_version": 2, "candidate_sha256": "f1e7a37af387274d7cb1481d1271249fd2b5f3ed732c7d2cc74db4b348e0840e", "engine": "pyshacl", "engine_version": "0.31.0", "engine_outcome": "COMPLETED_NO_ENGINE_ERROR", "diagnostic_availability": "Captured verbatim", "activation": {"roots": ["https://example.org/shapes#CategoryAShipShape"], "reachable": ["https://exa